# Python API

- FastAPI + Pydantic models. Bind `localhost`.
- User input is never written under `data/` or anywhere on disk.
- Talk to chat/embed models only through `app/providers` (`embed` / `generate`). RAG and LangGraph use Ollama. The Vector DB lab uses `hashed_ngram_embed` so it works without Llama.
- CORS allowlist is localhost web origins. Do not log request bodies.

```python
# ❌ BAD
settings.host = "0.0.0.0"
open("data/corpus/user.txt", "w").write(question)

# ✅ GOOD
settings.host = "localhost"
chunks = retrieve(question)  # in-memory Chroma
```
